d":"Gateway.NG4_286.Text","value":""},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_287.Text","value":"配置管理方式"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_288.Text","value":"Configuration ownership"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_289.Text","value":""},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_290.Text","value":"管理模式与本地维护…"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_291.Text","value":"Ownership & local maintenance…"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_292.Text","value":"检查并保存连接…"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_293.Text","value":"Review connection settings…"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_294.Text","value":"本地采集与组批设置"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_295.Text","value":"Local collection & batching"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_296.Text","value":"本地采集与组批"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_297.Text","value":"Local collection & batching"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_298.Text","value":"周期单位为毫秒。设置后检查设备点位，再确认配置生效。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_299.Text","value":"Periods are in milliseconds. Review devices and points, then activate the draft."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_300.Text","value":"采集总开关（true 启用 \/ false 停用）"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_301.Text","value":"Collection enabled (true \/ false)"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_302.Text","value":""},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_303.Text","value":""},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_304.Text","value":"组批周期 \/ 毫秒"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_305.Text","value":"Batch interval \/ ms"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_306.Text","value":""},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_307.Text","value":""},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_308.Text","value":"每包点数上限（1～64）"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_309.Text","value":"Maximum points per batch (1–64)"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_310.Text","value":""},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_311.Text","value":""},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_312.Text","value":"组批周期控制网关多久组织一次待发送数据，采集周期由各点位决定。\n超过每包点数上限时自动分包，多个设备的数据可以出现在同一批中。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_313.Text","value":"Batch interval controls how often pending values are grouped. Each point has its own poll period.\nLarge batches are split automatically; a batch may contain points from multiple devices."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_314.Text","value":"检查并使配置生效"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_315.Text","value":"Review & activate"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_316.Text","value":"返回连接设置"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_317.Text","value":"Back to connection"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_318.Text","value":"确认删除"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_319.Text","value":"Confirm removal"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_320.Text","value":"只修改待生效配置。删除设备会同时移除它的全部点位。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_321.Text","value":"Only the draft changes. Removing a device also removes all its points."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_322.Text","value":"放弃未生效的修改？"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_323.Text","value":"Discard unapplied changes?"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_324.Text","value":"用当前运行配置更新列表，已保存到控制器的运行配置不变。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_325.Text","value":"Replace the draft with the running configuration. Saved controller settings stay active."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_326.Text","value":"使配置生效并保存"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_327.Text","value":"Activate and save configuration"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_328.Text","value":"完整校验设备与点位；保存成功后按新配置采集，重启自动恢复。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_329.Text","value":"The complete draft is validated, saved and activated. It restores after restart."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_330.Text","value":"确认连接设置"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_331.Text","value":"Review connection settings"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_332.Text","value":"保存后连接会短暂中断，再自动连接新地址；请确认网络参数正确。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_333.Text","value":"Saving briefly disconnects MQTT, then reconnects automatically using these settings."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_334.Text","value":""},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_335.Text","value":""},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_336.Text","value":""},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_337.Text","value":""},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_338.Text","value":"确认后从草稿移除；仍需“使配置生效”才会停止采集。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_339.Text","value":"After removal, activate the draft to stop acquisition."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_340.Text","value":"删除设备及其点位"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_341.Text","value":"Remove device and its points"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_342.Text","value":"删除所选点位"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_343.Text","value":"Remove selected point"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_344.Text","value":"取消，返回列表"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_345.Text","value":"Cancel"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_346.Text","value":"草稿中的新增、编辑、删除都将被放弃。\n仅查看最新配置时，可返回列表；显示会自动更新。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_347.Text","value":"All additions, edits and removals in the draft will be discarded.\nTo view updates, return to the list; it refreshes automatically."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_348.Text","value":"放弃修改并更新显示"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_349.Text","value":"Discard draft & refresh"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_350.Text","value":"保留修改，返回"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_351.Text","value":"Keep changes"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_352.Text","value":"连接设置与设备点表分开保存。此操作只使设备与点位配置生效。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_353.Text","value":"Connection settings are separate. This action activates devices and points."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_354.Text","value":"确认生效并保存到控制器"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_355.Text","value":"Activate & save to controller"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_356.Text","value":"返回继续检查"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_357.Text","value":"Back to review"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_358.Text","value":"服务器地址"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_359.Text","value":"Broker URI"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_360.Text","value":""},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_361.Text","value":"网关标识"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_362.Text","value":"Gateway ID"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_363.Text","value":""},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_364.Text","value":"管理模式"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_365.Text","value":"Management mode"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_366.Text","value":""},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_367.Text","value":"连接保存不切换管理模式。仅更换网关标识会重置本地点表，请谨慎操作。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_368.Text","value":"Saving a connection does not change ownership. Changing gateway ID resets local points."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_369.Text","value":"确认保存并自动重连"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_370.Text","value":"Save & reconnect automatically"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_371.Text","value":"返回修改"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_372.Text","value":"Back to edit"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_373.Text","value":"使用流程与自动恢复"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_374.Text","value":"Workflow & automatic recovery"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_375.Text","value":"平台统一管理为主，本地维护用于本地维护场景。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_376.Text","value":"Use Hub as the primary owner. Local editing is intended for standalone use."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_377.Text","value":"01  平台管理（推荐）"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_378.Text","value":"01  Hub managed (recommended)"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_379.Text","value":"在 Hub 添加设备与点位，设置采集、上报周期并发布。\n网关自动接收、校验、保存并回执；此页自动显示最新配置。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_380.Text","value":"Add devices and points in Hub, set periods, then publish.\nThe gateway validates, saves and acknowledges the configuration. This UI updates automatically."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_381.Text","value":"02  本地维护"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_382.Text","value":"02  Standalone operation"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_383.Text","value":"先从“管理与维护”进入维护，默认保留点表，再编辑并确认生效。\n本地改动不上传平台；交还时恢复平台配置，再在 Hub 重试受阻发布。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_384.Text","value":"Add device → save device → add points → save points → activate.\nSaving a draft does not change acquisition. Discard restores the running configuration."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_385.Text","value":"03  断线与重启"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_386.Text","value":"03  Connection loss & restart"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_387.Text","value":"断线后自动重连，恢复网络后继续上报；重启自动恢复已保存配置。\n内存队列不跨重启保存；断网期间不保证每次采样都留存。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_388.Text","value":"Reconnection, reporting and saved configuration restore automatically.\nThe RAM queue does not survive restart or retain every offline sample."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_389.Text","value":"配置管理与本地维护"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_390.Text","value":"Configuration ownership"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_391.Text","value":"切换无需更换网关标识。模式和已生效配置都会保存，重启后自动恢复。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_392.Text","value":"Keep the gateway ID. Ownership and active settings persist across restart."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_393.Text","value":""},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_394.Text","value":"最近平台配置版本"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_395.Text","value":"Saved Hub version"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_396.Text","value":""},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_397.Text","value":"本地维护修订号（独立计数）"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_398.Text","value":"Local maintenance revision"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_399.Text","value":""},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_400.Text","value":"平台管理：在 Hub 发布点表，HMI 查看和诊断。\n本地维护：手动接管；平台配置会收到冲突回执，不会覆盖本地修改。\n本地点表改变后继续采集，暂停写入 Hub，交还平台后恢复。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_401.Text","value":"Hub owns normal configuration; HMI provides viewing and diagnostics.\nMaintenance locks incoming configuration with an explicit conflict receipt.\nLocal edits keep acquisition running but pause Hub telemetry until handback."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_402.Text","value":"进入本地维护…"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_403.Text","value":"Enter local maintenance…"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_404.Text","value":"交还平台管理…"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_405.Text","value":"Return ownership to Hub…"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_406.Text","value":"返回设备列表"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_407.Text","value":"Back to devices"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_408.Text","value":"进入本地维护"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_409.Text","value":"Enter local maintenance"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_410.Text","value":"默认保留当前设备和点位；只有主动选择清空才移除本地点表。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_411.Text","value":"Current devices and points are retained by default. Clearing is optional."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_412.Text","value":"网关标识保持不变。平台配置先备份，随后暂停应用平台下发。\n模式切换会放弃未生效草稿；已生效点表按下面的选项处理。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_413.Text","value":"Gateway ID stays unchanged. The Hub configuration is saved before locking updates.\nUnapplied draft edits are discarded. Choose how to handle the active point table."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_414.Text","value":"保留设备与点位（推荐）"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_415.Text","value":"Keep devices & points (recommended)"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_416.Text","value":"保留设备与点位（推荐）"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_417.Text","value":"Keep devices & points (recommended)"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_418.Text","value":"清空本地点表，重新配置"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_419.Text","value":"Clear local points and start fresh"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_420.Text","value":"清空本地点表，重新配置"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_421.Text","value":"Clear local points and start fresh"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_422.Text","value":"已选择保留：进入后继续按当前点表采集，不删除设备和点位。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_423.Text","value":"Keep selected: collection continues with the current devices and points."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_424.Text","value":"已选择清空：确认后停止现有点表采集，但保留平台备份。\n该操作不删除 Hub 中的设备；交还平台时可恢复平台点表。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_425.Text","value":"Clear selected: collection stops for the local table; the Hub backup is kept.\nHub devices are not deleted. Handback restores the saved Hub table."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_426.Text","value":"保留点表并进入维护"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_427.Text","value":"Keep points & enter maintenance"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_428.Text","value":"确认清空并进入维护"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_429.Text","value":"Confirm clear & enter maintenance"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_430.Text","value":"取消，保持当前模式"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_431.Text","value":"Cancel; keep current mode"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_432.Text","value":"交还平台管理"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_433.Text","value":"Return ownership to Hub"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_434.Text","value":"本地修改不会自动写回 Hub。确认后恢复平台点表，再继续接收平台发布。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_435.Text","value":"Local changes are not uploaded to Hub. Confirm to restore Hub ownership and its saved table."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_436.Text","value":"若已有平台备份：恢复进入维护前最后生效的平台设备、点位和周期。\n本地生效修改与未生效草稿会放弃；网关标识不变，不清空平台点表。\n若没有平台备份：保留本地采集，等待平台首次发布建立基线。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_437.Text","value":"With a Hub backup: restore the last applied Hub devices, points and periods.\nLocal edits and unapplied draft changes are discarded; gateway ID stays unchanged.\nWithout a backup: keep local collection while awaiting initial Hub configuration."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_438.Text","value":"维护期间收到冲突回执的发布，请在 Hub 点击重试。\n后续增量配置按平台版本和消息标识校验，不与本地修订混用。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_439.Text","value":"Retry any release rejected during maintenance from Hub.\nPatch validation uses the Hub version and message ID, independently of local revisions."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_440.Text","value":"确认恢复平台配置并交还管理"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_441.Text","value":"Restore Hub configuration & hand back"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_442.Text","value":"取消，继续本地维护"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_443.Text","value":"Cancel; stay in maintenance"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_444.Text","value":"选择数据类型"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_445.Text","value":"Choose data type"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_446.Text","value":"点击选项后返回点位详情，仍需保存点位。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_447.Text","value":"Choose an option, then save the point."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_448.Text","value":"16 位无符号整数"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_449.Text","value":"16-bit unsigned"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_450.Text","value":"16 位有符号整数"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_451.Text","value":"16-bit signed"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_452.Text","value":"32 位无符号整数"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_453.Text","value":"32-bit unsigned"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_454.Text","value":"32 位有符号整数"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_455.Text","value":"32-bit signed"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_456.Text","value":"32 位浮点数"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_457.Text","value":"32-bit float"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_458.Text","value":"布尔值"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_459.Text","value":"Boolean"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_460.Text","value":"返回点位详情"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_461.Text","value":"Back to point"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_462.Text","value":"选择寄存器区域"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_463.Text","value":"Choose register area"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_464.Text","value":"点击选项后返回点位详情，仍需保存点位。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_465.Text","value":"Choose an option, then save the point."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_466.Text","value":"保持寄存器"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_467.Text","value":"Holding register"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_468.Text","value":"输入寄存器"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_469.Text","value":"Input register"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_470.Text","value":"线圈"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_471.Text","value":"Coil"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_472.Text","value":"离散输入"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_473.Text","value":"Discrete input"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_474.Text","value":"返回点位详情"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_475.Text","value":"Back to point"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_476.Text","value":"选择上报方式"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_477.Text","value":"Choose report mode"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_478.Text","value":"点击选项后返回点位详情，仍需保存点位。"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_479.Text","value":"Choose an option, then save the point."},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_480.Text","value":"定时：按上报周期发送"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_481.Text","value":"Cyclic: at the report interval"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_482.Text","value":"变化：超过死区后发送"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_483.Text","value":"On change: beyond the deadband"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_484.Text","value":"变化或定时：任一条件满足即发送"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_485.Text","value":"Change or cyclic: either condition"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_486.Text","value":"返回点位详情"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_487.Text","value":"Back to point"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_488.Text","value":""},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_489.Text","value":"最近操作"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_490.Text","value":"Last action"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_491.Text","value":""},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_492.Text","value":""},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_493.Text","value":"放弃草稿 \/ 更新显示…"},{"id":"Gateway.NG4_494.Text","value":"Discard draft \/ refresh…"},{"id":"Login.useridLabel.Text","value":"User"},{"id":"Login.passwordLabel.Text","value":"Password"},{"id":"Login.username.Text","value":""},{"id":"Login.login.Text","value":"Log In"},{"id":"Login.cancel.Text","value":"Cancel"},{"id":"Login.password.Text","value":""},{"id":"Login.Text1.Text","value":"Text"},{"id":"Login.SystemUseNotificationDE.Text","value":"Dieses Gerät ist nur für den autorisierten \nGebrauch!\n\nDieses Gerät (Industrie Steuerung) darf nur \nvon autorisierten Benutzern verwendet \nwerden. \n\nPersonen, die dieses Gerät verwenden, und \nalle Benutzeraktionen auf diesem Gerät \nkönnen aufgezeichnet, kopiert, und auditiert \nwerden. \n\nDie unautorisierte Verwendung ist nicht \nerlaubt. \n\nDurch die weitere Verwendung dieses \nGeräts erklären Sie sich mit diesen \nBedingungen einverstanden."},{"id":"Login.SystemUseNotificationEN.Text","value":"This device is for authorized use only!\n\nThis device (Industrial Control System) is for \nthe use of authorized users only. \n\nIndividuals using this device and all user \nactions on this device may be recorded, \ncopied and audited. \n\nUnauthorized use, without authority, or in \nexcess of authority is prohibited. \n\nBy continuing to use this device you indicate \nyour awareness of and consent to these \nterms of use."},{"id":"Login.Text2.Text","value":""}]}]}